    "collectionNotes": [
      "Lighthouse warned that the homepage-linked /ar/ service and contact URLs redirect to their canonical ministry paths. The destinations were corroborated in HTTP and browser observations. These real entry chains remain in the measurements; the warning is not counted as a broken link.",
      "Completion review 2026-10-26 of the 21 October follow-up: 0 previously unmeasured criteria resolved, adding 0 assessed budget points. 3/3 additional core-page follow-ups were representative; excluded captures and original attempts are retained. Prior valid timing samples are unchanged. 26 criteria remain unmeasured; see the completion record for required evidence.",
      "Supplementary GET search tasks, where present, use observed search forms and do not expand the original Lighthouse timing sample. Retained visual comparison is explicitly distinguished from fresh capture. Collector connection failures, robots exclusions and incomplete responses are never website zeros.",
      "Coverage revision 2026-10-28: 0 further criteria resolved using explicit reviewed evidence. Restricted, untested and monitoring-dependent criteria remain unmeasured. Scores and measurement coverage are different quantities; no conversion of missing evidence to passes or zeros."
    ],
    "supplementaryPages": [],
    "findings": [
      {
        "title": "Reduce mobile loading cost and verify repeatability",
        "detail": "The mobile homepage lab LCP median was 17.14 seconds (range 16.01–18.55 seconds, three successful runs). Median transfer was 2.95 MB. Inspect the LCP element and render-critical resources; these session measurements are not field p75 or a fixed loading time for every visitor."
      },
      {
        "title": "Stabilize the page layout during loading",
        "detail": "Worst repeated page/device median lab CLS was 1.001, exceeding the frozen pilot zero-credit threshold of 0.25. Reserve media/widget space and inspect layout-shift traces; this is load-time lab evidence, not field CLS."
      },
      {
        "title": "Name social and search links",
        "detail": "Rendered YouTube/Instagram and search icon links lacked accessible names. Axe and captured anchors corroborated the shared issue."
      },
      {
        "title": "Improve semantic structure and finish contrast validation",
        "detail": "Add a main landmark and review heading levels. The automated footer contrast warning differed from the independent follow-up background; contrast remains unmeasured until that state is reproduced."
      },
      {
        "title": "Deploy security policies and consistent cookie flags",
        "detail": "HSTS and enforced CSP were absent from the three captured responses. Cookie protection was inconsistent, including a cookie without Secure, HttpOnly or explicit SameSite."
      },
      {
        "title": "Extend service guidance beyond discovery",
        "detail": "The accordions open and describe service categories, but downstream operator applications, requirements and completion need separate testing. These are not validated end-to-end services."
      }
    ],
