    "collectionNotes": [
      "An initial normal-browser follow-up returned local filtering interstitials. Those documents were excluded and retained privately. A normal Chrome UA follow-up rendered all three ministry pages; original failed observations are not scored as ministry failures.",
      "The guarded observation excluded numerous subresources. Independent normal-browser checks confirmed the 415px narrow-screen overflow and the language-link contrast defect; absence of automated axe violations is not used as proof of conformity.",
      "Completion review 2026-10-26 of the 21 October follow-up: 0 previously unmeasured criteria resolved, adding 0 assessed budget points. 3/3 additional core-page follow-ups were representative; excluded captures and original attempts are retained. Prior valid timing samples are unchanged. 24 criteria remain unmeasured; see the completion record for required evidence.",
      "Supplementary GET search tasks, where present, use observed search forms and do not expand the original Lighthouse timing sample. Retained visual comparison is explicitly distinguished from fresh capture. Collector connection failures, robots exclusions and incomplete responses are never website zeros.",
      "Coverage revision 2026-10-28: 0 further criteria resolved using explicit reviewed evidence. Restricted, untested and monitoring-dependent criteria remain unmeasured. Scores and measurement coverage are different quantities; no conversion of missing evidence to passes or zeros."
    ],
    "supplementaryPages": [
      {
        "type": "contact-detail",
        "url": "https://www.m-culture.gov.dz/index.php/ar/2016-11-21-10-40-49/905-%D8%B9%D9%86%D8%A7%D9%88%D9%8A%D9%86-%D9%88%D8%B2%D8%A7%D8%B1%D8%A9-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%AB%D9%82%D8%A7%D9%81%D8%A9"
      }
    ],
    "findings": [
      {
        "title": "Reduce mobile loading cost",
        "detail": "The mobile homepage LCP median was 33.30 seconds, range 26.02–33.54 seconds across three successful simulated runs. Inspect render-critical resources; this operator-network sample is not field p75 or a fixed experience for every visitor."
      },
      {
        "title": "Remove the narrow-screen width constraint",
        "detail": "The normal-browser document width was 415px at both 320px and 390px on all three reviewed pages. Adjust the shared layout so content fits without horizontal scrolling."
      },
      {
        "title": "Improve the language link contrast and image alternatives",
        "detail": "The Français control measured 2.29:1 against white at 14px. Replace generic numeric/banner alternatives with useful descriptions and remove the leaked slider promotion text."
      },
      {
        "title": "Add semantic landmarks and response policies",
        "detail": "The reviewed DOMs lacked main/navigation landmarks. HSTS and enforced CSP were absent from the three response captures, and cookie flags were mixed."
      }
    ],
