            "points": 0,
            "status": "zero",
            "reason": "Reviewed both the header and meta policies together. default-src * with unsafe-inline in the header and wildcard/unsafe-inline/unsafe-eval script sources plus wildcard object sources in the meta policy remain permissive even when intersected. The policy does not meet the frozen meaningful script/object restriction rule. No exploit was attempted.",
